# sys-hall-of-fame (docs/research/hall-of-fame-credits.md): a constructed
# start (setup lines, no story chain) in the Champion room as the elevator lands, a team of six at level 100. Cynthia's
# room script walks the player up and starts her battle (267, fought with the battle auto policy); she leads the
# player to the Hall of Fame (the hallway's and the room's scripts: get_league_victories 0, the first-victory
# lines, the Hall of Fame machine's balls), and clear_game: the Champion ribbons, the record screen (A once the
# whole team stands on the final screen), the save, the credits (unskippable on a first clear: the final screen
# waits for frame 10080), the OpenSinnoh card, the reset. CONTINUE then loads the clear's save in the player's
# room upstairs in Twinleaf, facing up, with one Hall of Fame entry and the party healed.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 100 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW platinum:MOVE_CRUNCH platinum:MOVE_FIRE_FANG
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_INFERNAPE 100 platinum:MOVE_FLARE_BLITZ platinum:MOVE_CLOSE_COMBAT platinum:MOVE_THUNDER_PUNCH platinum:MOVE_MACH_PUNCH
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_LUCARIO 100 platinum:MOVE_AURA_SPHERE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_PULSE platinum:MOVE_DARK_PULSE platinum:MOVE_FLASH_CANNON
party 3 platinum:SPECIES_STARAPTOR 100 platinum:MOVE_BRAVE_BIRD platinum:MOVE_CLOSE_COMBAT platinum:MOVE_RETURN platinum:MOVE_QUICK_ATTACK
party 4 platinum:SPECIES_GYARADOS 100 platinum:MOVE_WATERFALL platinum:MOVE_ICE_FANG platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_RETURN
party 5 platinum:SPECIES_MAMOSWINE 100 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_ICE_SHARD platinum:MOVE_STONE_EDGE platinum:MOVE_ICE_FANG
# The opening's TV program in the player's room is long over (the room's frame script would run it again).
set var platinum:VAR_PLAYER_HOUSE_SPECIAL_PROGRAM_STATE 1
set var platinum:VAR_PLAYER_HOUSE_STATE 7
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_LEAGUE_CHAMPION_ROOM 8 17 up
advance text 3000
battle auto 60000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_CHAMPION_CYNTHIA won single
advance text 20000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_DEFEATED_CYNTHIA true
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_POKEMON_LEAGUE_HALL_OF_FAME
+0 assert app hall-of-fame
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED true
+0 assert state party[0].ribbons [32]
+0 assert state party[5].ribbons [32]
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_PLAYER_HOUSE_POSTGAME_STATE 1
+0 screenshot hall-of-fame-member
# The record screen: each member alone, then the group; only the final screen takes A.
+1500 screenshot hall-of-fame-group
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app credits 600
+0 assert state hallOfFame.total 1
+0 assert state hallOfFame.entries[0].party[5].species "platinum:SPECIES_MAMOSWINE"
+600 screenshot credits-scroll
+7900 screenshot credits-final
+1700 screenshot credits-card
until app none 1000
+0 reset
until idle 600
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_TWINLEAF_TOWN_PLAYER_HOUSE_2F 4 6
+0 assert state player.facing "up"
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_COMMUNICATION_CLUB_ACCESSIBLE false
+0 assert state hallOfFame.total 1
+0 assert state party[0].ribbons [32]
